  approach="Brand identity built out across every touchpoint a prospective resident or family would actually encounter: monument signage, brochures, flyers, and rack cards — consistent from the entrance sign to the leasing table."
  result="One of Tingen Creative's largest engagements to date, and proof that a brand identity has to hold up in the physical world, not just on a screen."
